Description: academic literature search and export tool
 Lixplore searches PubMed, arXiv, Crossref, DOAJ and Europe PMC from the
 command line, with Boolean queries, deduplication across sources and
 date filtering.
 .
 Results can be annotated with ratings, tags and notes, formatted as
 APA/MLA/Chicago/IEEE citations, and exported to CSV, JSON, BibTeX, RIS,
 XLSX, EndNote and XML. "lixplore --tui" opens a terminal interface
 (full-screen with Textual 4 or newer, otherwise a simpler Rich one),
 and saved searches can be run as alerts with lixplore-alerts.
